    "The deposits-only concept removes interbank-transactions liabilities from the outcome so the project can distinguish 'deposit scope' from the broader `total_deposits_bank_qoq` object.",
    "At h0 for `total_deposits_including_interbank`, the U.S.-chartered bank-leg-matched TDC makes the derived non-TDC residual more negative than the current baseline by about 15.00.",
    "At h0 for `total_deposits_including_interbank`, removing only the rest-of-world term makes the derived non-TDC residual more negative than the current baseline by about 2.39.",
    "At h0 for `deposits_only_ex_interbank`, the U.S.-chartered bank-leg-matched TDC makes the derived non-TDC residual more negative than the current baseline by about 15.04.",
